.TH pvc-completions 1  "pvc-completions " 
.SH NAME
pvc\-completions \- Print a shell completion script to stdout
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpvc\-completions\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISHELL\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print a shell completion script to stdout.
.PP
Source it directly, or write it to your shell\*(Aqs own completion directory, e.g. `pvc completions zsh > ~/.zfunc/_pvc` (make sure `~/.zfunc` is on `fpath` first).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
<\fISHELL\fR>

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
bash
.IP \(bu 2
elvish
.IP \(bu 2
fish
.IP \(bu 2
powershell
.IP \(bu 2
zsh
.RE
